parts":[{"text":"ஏம்","lemma":"ஏம்","gloss":"we are"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"we are indeed in"}]}],"literal":"Venus and vast sky rising up birds and / high branches in nests voices raised indeed / and ponds bud-eyes opened slowly / and lamps diminished light indeed songs having risen / reverberating sound with drums right-spiralled conches roaring / night that saw the back at morning appearing / steel weapons darkness dispelling protective camp / at dawn sound may you hear many victories / garland-wearer O broad-chested one please rise from sleep saying / clear-skinned drumhead large drum to sound clearly beating / at the tall gate having appeared I indeed that desiring / thinking of who came the suppliant this man saying / soaked in ghee fried having rich seasoning large pieces of roasted meat / gem-like vessels filled with sweet-smelling clear liquor / sloughed snake-skin like fine white patterned with garments / rain like with generosity showering / summer like my distress to be removed / rare ornaments having granted he indeed always / in the fields blossomed red-petalled lotus / six-fold duties sages performing righteousness nurtured / with sacrificial fire shining lord of the land of sharp sword / victorious in the island wearing gold ornaments Valavan / dashing waves great ocean at the boundary even if it overflows / burning rays sun in the southern sky even if it rises / saying what we will not fear we indeed victorious / difficult battles conquering strength his / perfected hero's anklets strong feet cool shade we are indeed in","translation":"Venus has risen in the vast sky, and birds on high branches have raised their voices from their nests. The lotus buds in the ponds have slowly opened their eyes, and the lamps have dimmed their light. As songs arise, accompanied by reverberating drums and the roar of right-spiralled conches, dawn appears, driving away the night. In the protective camp where steel weapons dispel the darkness, I stood at the tall gate, beating my clear-skinned drum to wake you, saying, 'O broad-chested king adorned with garlands of victory, please rise from your sleep.' Knowing my desire, you welcomed me, saying, 'He is a suppliant who came thinking of me.' You showered me with rich, ghee-soaked roasted meat, sweet-smelling clear liquor filled in gem-like vessels, and fine white garments like sloughed snake-skin. With rain-like generosity, you granted me rare ornaments, removing my summer-like distress. Even if the great ocean with its dashing waves overflows its boundaries, or the hot-rayed sun rises in the southern sky, we have nothing to fear. For we live forever under the cool shade of the strong, ankleted feet of Valavan, the victorious king of the golden ornaments, whose land shines with the sacrificial fires of the righteous sages.","modern":"விண்ணில் வெள்ளியெழுந்து பறவைகள் கூடுகளில் ஒலியெழுப்பின. குளத்துத் தாமரை மொட்டுகள் மெல்ல மலர்ந்தன. விளக்குகள் ஒளியிழந்தன. முரசுகளும் வலம்புரிச் சங்குகளும் முழங்க விடியல் தோன்றியது. பகைவரை வெல்லும் பாசறையில் விடியற்காலத்து ஒலியைக் கேட்டு, 'வெற்றிமாலை அணிந்த மார்பனே, துயில் எழுவாயாக' என்று பாடி, என் கிணைப்பறையை முழக்கி உன் வாயிலில் நின்றேன். அதனைக் கண்டு, 'இவன் நம்மை நாடி வந்த பரிசிலன்' என்று கூறி, நெய் சொரியும் பொரித்த இறைச்சியையும், மணமிக்க தேறலையும், பாம்புத் தோல் போன்ற மெல்லிய ஆடைகளையும், அணிகலன்களையும் மாரி போல வாரி வழங்கினாய். என் வறுமைத் துன்பத்தைப் போக்கினாய். அலைமோதும் பெருங்கடல் தன் எல்லையைக் கடந்து பொங்கினாலும், சுடுகதிர்ச் செல்வன் தென்திசையில் தோன்றினாலும், நாம் எதற்கும் அஞ்சமாட்டோம். ஏனெனில், வேள்வித் தீ விளங்கும் சோழ நாட்டின் தலைவனான கிள்ளிவளவனின் திருவடி நிழலில் நாம் என்றும் பாதுகாப்பாக வாழ்கின்றோம்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Pāṭāṇ tiṇai and depicts the theme of 'parisil viṭai' (taking leave after receiving gifts). The poet Erukkāṭṭūr Tāyaṅkaṇṇaṉār praises the Chola king Kiḷḷi Vaḷavaṉ, who died at Kuḷamuṟṟam. The poet describes arriving at the king's camp at dawn, waking him with the sound of his drum (kiṇai), and receiving lavish hospitality. The king gives him seasoned roasted meat, clear liquor in precious vessels, fine white garments, and rare ornaments, effectively dispelling his poverty. The poem concludes with a powerful statement of absolute security under the king's rule. Even if cosmic anomalies occur, such as the ocean overflowing or the sun rising in the south, the poet declares that those protected by the king have nothing to fear.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,1.9],[1.9,3.3],[3.3,3.76],[3.76,4.0],[4.15,4.6],[4.6,5.6],[5.6,7.16],[7.16,7.16],[7.16,7.16],[7.16,7.16],[7.16,8.4],[8.4,8.8],[8.8,8.86],[8.86,8.9],[8.9,11.1],[11.1,11.2],[11.2,11.7],[11.7,12.8],[12.8,13.1],[13.1,13.3],[13.3,14.0],[14.6,15.2],[15.2,15.7],[15.7,15.7],[15.7,16.1],[16.1,17.4],[17.4,17.4],[17.4,18.27],[18.27,18.6],[19.32,20.02],[20.02,20.42],[20.42,20.92],[20.92,21.22],[21.22,21.29],[21.29,22.32],[22.32,22.72],[22.72,22.92],[22.92,23.62],[23.73,24.52],[24.52,25.12],[25.12,25.22],[25.22,25.42],[25.42,26.02],[26.02,26.72],[26.72,27.02],[27.02,27.02],[27.02,27.62],[27.82,28.02],[28.02,29.29],[29.29,29.56],[29.56,30.02],[30.02,30.32],[30.32,31.82],[31.82,32.32],[32.32,32.82],[32.82,33.22],[33.22,34.42],[34.42,34.82],[34.82,35.22],[35.22,36.02],[36.02,36.32],[36.32,36.62],[36.62,36.92],[36.92,37.22],[38.96,39.56],[39.56,39.76],[39.76,39.96],[39.96,40.16],[40.16,40.76],[40.76,41.66],[41.66,41.96],[41.96,42.26],[42.26,42.66],[42.79,43.66],[43.66,43.96],[43.96,44.09],[44.09,44.26],[44.26,46.06],[46.06,46.16],[46.45,47.16],[47.16,47.36],[47.36,48.46],[48.46,48.56],[48.56,48.96],[48.96,49.36],[49.36,49.9],[50.17,51.26],[51.26,51.76],[51.76,51.76],[51.76,53.16],[53.16,53.46],[53.46,53.86],[53.86,54.26],[54.26,55.26],[55.26,55.26],[55.26,56.56],[56.56,56.86],[57.84,58.54],[58.54,58.74],[58.74,59.44],[59.44,59.84],[59.84,60.74],[60.74,61.24],[61.24,61.64],[61.64,61.84],[61.84,63.15],[63.15,63.24],[63.24,63.78],[63.78,64.24]],"female":[